{"resource": {"name": "Unemployment Rate - Bay Area (2022) DRAFT", "id": "yhx9-kd4k", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Unemployment Rate - Bay Area (2022) DRAFT\n\nVITAL SIGNS INDICATOR\nUnemployment (EC3)\n\nFULL MEASURE NAME\nUnemployment rate by residential location\n\nLAST UPDATED\nJuly 2022\n\nDESCRIPTION\nUnemployment refers to the share of the labor force \u2013 by place of residence \u2013 that is not currently employed full-time or part-time. The unemployment rate reflects the strength of the overall employment market.\n\nDATA SOURCE\nCalifornia Employment Development Department: Historical Unemployment Rates\n1990-2021\nhttps://data.edd.ca.gov/Labor-Force-and-Unemployment-Rates/Local-Area-Unemployment-Statistics-LAUS-Annual-Ave/7jbb-3rb8\nhttps://data.edd.ca.gov/Labor-Force-and-Unemployment-Rates/Local-Area-Unemployment-Statistics-LAUS-/e6gw-gvii/data\n\nCONTACT INFORMATION\nvitalsigns.info@bayareametro.gov\n\nMETHODOLOGY NOTES (across all datasets for this indicator)\nUnemployment rates produced by EDD for the region and county levels are not adjusted for seasonality (as they reflect annual data) and are final data (i.e., not preliminary). Unemployment rates produced by BLS for the metro regions are annual and not adjusted for seasonality; they reflect the primary MSA for the named region, except for the San Francisco Bay Area which uses the nine-county region. The unemployment rate is calculated based on the number of unemployed persons divided by the total labor force. Note that the unemployment rate can decline or increase as a result of changes in either variable.", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-12-05T20:46:32.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-07-20T20:45:10.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-20T20:45:12.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-12-05T20:46:32.000Z", "columns_name": ["Source", "Unemployment_Rate", "Unemployment", "Year", "Employment", "Labor_Force", "Objectid", "Region"], "columns_field_name": ["source", "unemployment_rate", "unemployment", "year", "employment", "labor_force", "objectid", "region"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Source", "Unemployment Rate", "Unemployment", "Year", "Employment", "Labor Force", "objectid", "Region"], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-07-20T20:45:12.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Economy", "domain_tags": ["ec3", "vital signs", "vital signs 2.0"], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.bayareametro.gov"}, "permalink": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/d/yhx9-kd4k", "link": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/Economy/Unemployment-Rate-Bay-Area-2022-DRAFT/yhx9-kd4k", "owner": {"id": "43ws-93gp", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Aksel"}, "creator": {"id": "43ws-93gp", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Aksel"}}
{"resource": {"name": "City_Limits", "id": "yhz4-y89p", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>City boundaries within Alameda County. Boundaries represent voting city (i.e., city designation for each address) and therefore may align with parcel boundaries in cases where parcels (and sometimes residences) are divided by the true city boundary. (See City Limits layer created by Alameda County Community Development Agency for true city limits boundaries.)</SPAN></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2021-08-10T22:36:12.000Z", "createdAt": "2021-08-10T22:36:07.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2021-08-10T22:36:09.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2021-08-10T22:36:12.000Z", "columns_name": ["Shape_STLength_12", "Shape__Length", "OBJECTID", "Shape__Area", "DISTRICT_ID", "Shape_STArea_12", "Shape_STLength_1", "DIST_NAME", "Shape_STArea_1", "the_geom"], "columns_field_name": ["shape_stlength_12", "shape_length", "objectid", "shape_area", "district_id", "shape_starea_12", "shape_stlength_1", "dist_name", "shape_starea_1", "the_geom"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "MultiPolygon"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2021-08-10T22:36:09.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_tags": [], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.bayareametro.gov"}, "permalink": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/d/yhz4-y89p", "link": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/dataset/City_Limits/yhz4-y89p", "owner": {"id": "gmr7-ynpt", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Kearey Smith"}, "creator": {"id": "gmr7-ynpt", "us