{"resource": {"name": "EAGPLU_Residential_Overlay", "id": "yiha-g2dd", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-01-20T17:42:23.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-01-20T17:42:20.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-01-20T17:42:21.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-01-20T17:42:23.000Z", "columns_name": ["Shape__Length", "Mx_Overlay", "Overlay", "OBJECTID", "Shape__Area", "the_geom"], "columns_field_name": ["shape_length", "mx_overlay", "overlay", "objectid", "shape_area", "the_geom"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Number", "MultiPolygon"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-01-20T17:42:21.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_tags": [], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.bayareametro.gov"}, "permalink": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/d/yiha-g2dd", "link": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/dataset/EAGPLU_Residential_Overlay/yiha-g2dd", "owner": {"id": "gmr7-ynpt", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Kearey Smith"}, "creator": {"id": "gmr7-ynpt", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Kearey Smith"}}
{"resource": {"name": "Vital Signs: Bridge Condition \u2013 Bay Area", "id": "yiih-pfj5", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "VITAL SIGNS INDICATOR\nBridge Condition (T18)\n\nFULL MEASURE NAME\nStructurally deficient share of bridge deck area\n\nLAST UPDATED\nMay 2017\n\nDESCRIPTION\nBridge condition is measured by the share of bridges and overpasses flagged as structurally deficient, weighted by bridge deck area to capture the relative size of the bridge. In short, this measure reflects the integrity of regional bridges and overpasses. Structural deficiency is identified based on the condition of the structure as assessed by engineering professionals (as opposed to just the roadway surface). The dataset includes metropolitan area, regional, county, and individual bridge tables.\n\nDATA SOURCE\nFederal Highway Administration: National Bridge Inventory (1992-2016)\nhttp://www.fhwa.dot.gov/bridge/nbi.cfm\n\nCONTACT INFORMATION\nvitalsigns.info@mtc.ca.gov\n\nMETHODOLOGY NOTES (across all datasets for this indicator)\nRegional performance was examined by summing all of the bridge deck area flagged as structurally deficient and dividing it by total bridge deck area. Metro comparisons were performed using current MSA boundaries and using the counties included to calculate past performance in those geographies; for the Bay Area, the nine-county region reflects regional performance instead of separate MSAs.", "attribution": "Federal Highway Administration", "attribution_link": "http://www.fhwa.dot.gov/bridge/nbi.cfm", "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2018-07-06T18:04:58.000Z", "createdAt": "2017-05-01T19:31:25.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2018-07-06T18:04:58.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2017-05-01T19:31:33.000Z", "columns_name": ["SD Deck Area", "Deck Area", "Region", "Year", "Percent", "Source"], "columns_field_name": ["sd_deck_area", "deck_area", "region", "year", "percent", "source"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Deck of all bridges flagged as structurally deficient", "Total deck area of all bridges", "", "", "Structurally deficient share of bridge deck area", ""], "columns_format": [{"precisionStyle": "standard", "noCommas": "false", "precision": "0", "align": "right"}, {"precisionStyle": "standard", "noCommas": "false", "precision": "0", "align": "right"}, {}, {"precisionStyle": "standard", "noCommas": "true", "align": "right"}, {"precisionStyle": "standard", "noCommas": "false", "precision": "4", "align": "right"}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2017-05-01T19:35:23.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": ["economy", "demographics"], "tags": [], "domain_tags": ["vital signs"], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.bayareametro.gov"}, "permalink": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/d/yiih-pfj5", "link": "https://data.bayareametro.gov/dataset/Vital-Signs-Bridge-Condition-Bay-Area/yiih-pfj5", "owner": {"id": "wg3i-tdm6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Raleigh McCoy"}, "creator": {"id": "wg3i-tdm6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Raleigh McCoy"}}
